	<Properties>
		<Name>Prussia</Name>
		<Stability>Alpha</Stability>
		<Teaser>Lead Prussia under Frederick the Great.</Teaser>
		<Description>Adds Prussia, led by Frederick the Great, as a playable civilization for Brave New World. Ethnic Units v31 is supported when enabled but is never required.</Description>
